arm64: configs: salami: Trim defconfig and build key drivers in

From: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>

将多个核心驱动由模块改为内建，移除无关平台配置，
显式禁用自动默认启用的模块以减少模块数量。

Signed-off-by: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>
